   "text": "Bishopstrow College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nBishopstrow College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nWe are an independent international boarding school offering English language and academic programmes to prepare international students, aged 7-17 years, for entry to leading boarding schools. At Bishopstrow College we prepare students for success through our specialised English Language Programme and Content and Language Integrated Learning classes. Since we were established in 2006, we have helped more than 2,000 students from around the world prepare for and gain entry to some of the best boarding schools in the UK and a number of leading boarding schools overseas. Situated on a beautiful campus in an Area of Outstanding Natural Beauty, on the edge of the ancient market town of Warminster and close to the attractive cities of Bath and Salisbury, we are a great place for students to live, learn and thrive.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 10:58\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:58\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nHigh School\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £18,475.00\nMin: £12,650.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n96%\n96 of 100 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nInspiring Futures Education (IFE)\nFounded Year\n2006\nCampus(es)\nBishopstrow\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n05/11/2024\nContract End Date\n05/11/2029\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.bishopstrow.com/welcome-to-boarding/accommodation/\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.bishopstrow.com/admissions/scholarships-and-bursaries/\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.